# First boot: a sixteenth trance gate at 120 BPM (bank 1, gate 50 %, depth 100 %).
# 8 steps a second -> 16 step triggers on J8 in 2 s; the gate cuts the level
# well below the ungated tone (0.135 rms); J7 swings the full envelope.
wait 3000
expect booted
sing 220
wait 500
mark
wait 2000
expect edges 8 > 13
expect edges 8 < 19
expect rms > 0.07
expect rms < 0.115
expect cvrange 7 > 4
expect led b1 amber
# GATE to 100 %: every step open the whole way -> the full level
pot 3 0.47
wait 300
pot 3 1.0
wait 600
mark
wait 1000
expect rms > 0.125
expect finite
